            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<strong>Introduction</strong><br>While back I watched a documentary in which the creator of popular game spoke of how he came up with the idea for the game. He was studying people and find out that people like to build things, and in this game the main objective is to build rows.<br>I wanted to create a game where you can also build things, but a little more complicated objects not just rows, and Mino Saga was born.<br><strong><br>Story</strong><br>In Mino Saga we follow main character Mino, and his task to rebuild the world. He travels over all continents in the world and build famous landmarks and buildings. In his voyage he is coming across all sort of difficulties, unique for each area he visits. <br><br><strong>Gameplay</strong><br>Mino Saga is new type of puzzle game, it's evolutionary concept for playing pentomino type of games. Mino Saga is mix of two worlds, bringing best of Pentomino games and fast game play. <br><br><strong>Features</strong><br>More than 200 Levels<br>Challenging game play<br>Store to upgrade and customize character<br>7 unique difficulties.<br>7 areas to explore<br>Leaderboards<br>Achivments<br>Endless game mod<br><br><strong>Things we DIDN’T include</strong><br>Easy game <br>Naked content (sorry)<br>Free trip to Moon",
