                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A Great mix between a Tetris and Jigsaw puzzle game.\nGame features a nice clean interface, plenty of game objectives to keep things interesting.\n\nHowever please note,  the \"single square block\" pieces seem to reset to the default 15 whenever you reset the game (Other reviewer did not discover this). Every few levels you will need to reset game (minor annoyance).\n\nOverall i really enjoyed my time with this game.",
